sequenceDiagram
    %% AgentUML: Generator-Critic (Reflection) Pattern
    %% Pattern: Generator produces output → Critic evaluates → Revision loop if failed
    %% Context-Window Risk: LOW — bounded critique loops with clear termination criteria
    %% Best for: Code generation, content writing, architectural review, test coverage

    participant U as User
    participant Gen as Generator Agent <<agent>>
    participant Crit as Critic Agent <<agent>>
    participant M as Working Memory <<memory_working>>
    participant LLM as Gemini LLM <<llm>>
    participant G as Output Guardrail <<guardrail>>

    U->>Gen: 1. Task: generate code / content

    Gen->>LLM: 2. Generate initial draft
    LLM-->>Gen: 3. Draft output

    loop Revision Loop (max 3 iterations)
        Gen->>Crit: 4. Submit draft for evaluation

        Note over Crit: Critic evaluates against rubric:<br/>• Correctness<br/>• Completeness<br/>• Safety constraints

        alt Passes rubric threshold
            Crit-->>Gen: 5a. PASS — quality score ≥ 0.85
        else Fails rubric threshold
            Crit-->>Gen: 5b. FAIL — quality score < 0.85 + diff feedback
            Gen->>M: 6. Append critique to scratchpad
            Gen->>LLM: 7. Revise with critic feedback
            LLM-->>Gen: 8. Revised draft
        end
    end

    Gen->>G: 9. Safety / policy check
    G-->>Gen: 10. Approved [no policy violation]
    Gen-->>U: 11. Final approved output
